# Byte-exact data trail: disable ALL line-ending conversion in this repo.
#
# The protocol's integrity mechanism is a SHA-256 of the bank file's exact
# bytes. Git's autocrlf conversion (default on Windows) would rewrite LF to
# CRLF on checkout, silently changing the hash and making every clone fail
# its own lock verification. Nothing in this repo is ever converted.
* -text
